---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Passage from '../../components/Passage.astro';
import References from '../../components/References.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import learning from '../../data/learning.json';
import '../../styles/app.css';
import {relationships} from '../../lib/assessment';
import {readings} from '../../data/content.json';
export function getStaticPaths(){return readings.map(item=>({params:{id:item.id},props:{item}}));}
const {item}=Astro.props;const nextApp=learning.related[0];
---
<Shell title={item.title}>
 <a class="back-link" href="/">← All context readings</a><section class="intro"><span class="motif" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="editorial">{item.title}</h1> <p>Quran {item.passage.ref} · {item.topic}</p></section>
 <Passage passage={item.passage}/>
 <div class="dossier"><section class="panel panel-body"><span class="eyebrow">The transmitted report</span> <h2>A named account</h2> <p class="micro">Narrator attribution: {item.narrator}</p><p>{item.reportSummary}</p><p class="micro">Original concise paraphrase. Read the complete linked report for its wording and chain.</p><div class="reading-note"><h3>What this establishes</h3><p>{item.establishes}</p></div><h3>What it does not settle</h3><p>{item.limits}</p><div class="source-boundary">{item.reliability}</div></section> <div class="dossier-side"><div class="sidebar"><HowItWorks>{' '}<p>Read the passage, then inspect what the named report establishes.</p><p>The three report categories are A reported occasion, General context and What happened after. The check asks you to choose one; the page then names the report's own category.</p></HowItWorks></div><aside class="panel panel-body"><h2>Read with commentary</h2> <p>{item.teaching}</p><p class="micro">Original concise English paraphrase of the fetched Al-Tafsir al-Muyassar. Full Arabic Ibn Kathir is linked below as a report-oriented second commentary. Its longer discussion is not reduced to an invented consensus.</p><section class="reading-quiz"><h3>What relationship is shown?</h3><form id="relationship" data-id={item.id} data-answer={relationships.indexOf(item.kind as typeof relationships[number])} data-explanation={item.establishes} data-ref={item.passage.ref} data-narrator={item.narrator} data-next-name={nextApp.name} data-next-url={nextApp.url}><fieldset><legend>Classify this report’s relationship to the passage</legend>{relationships.map(kind=><><label class="quiz-option"><input type="radio" name="answer" value={kind} required/> {kind}</label>{' '}</>)}</fieldset><button class="button top-gap">Check the relationship</button><p id="relationship-feedback" class="micro top-gap" role="status"></p></form><div id="session-end" aria-live="polite"></div></section></aside></div></div>
 <References sources={item.sources} commentaryUrl={item.commentaryUrl} secondCommentaryUrl={item.secondCommentaryUrl} secondLabel="Ibn Kathir · full Arabic, report-oriented commentary"/>
 <div class="reading-actions"><button class="button secondary" data-save={item.id} aria-pressed="false">Save</button> <button class="button secondary" data-print>Print this reading</button></div>
 <script>import '../../lib/library';import '../../lib/reading';</script>
</Shell>
